# TECHNICAL RULES

## Stack
- React + Vite + TypeScript
- Firebase (Firestore, Auth, Hosting, Functions)
- Stripe for billing — NEVER modify Stripe code without explicit approval
- Admin pages live in `src/pages/Admin*.tsx`
- Client pages live in `src/pages/*.tsx` (non-Admin)

## File conventions
- New admin components go in `src/components/Admin*/`
- New client components go in `src/components/`
- Shared utilities go in `src/lib/`
- Never edit `firestore.rules`, `firebase.json`, or `.github/workflows/*` without approval

## Code style
- Use `type` over `interface` where possible
- Use functional components with hooks
- Prefer named exports for utilities, default exports for pages
- All user-facing strings should use the i18n system when available
